  "title": "Contango Announces Results for the Quarter Ended March 31, 2026",
  "summary": "FAIRBANKS, Alaska, May 14, 2026 /PRNewswire/ – Contango Silver and Gold Inc. (“Contango” or the “Company”) (NYSE American: CTGO) (TSX: CTGO) announced today that it filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission its Form 10-Q for the quarter ended March 31, 2026 (“Q1-2026”). Rick Van Nieuwenhuyse, Chief Executive Officer of the Company, stated, “The first quarter of 2026 […]",
